  "description": "The Eiffel Test Suite Started event (ID\u202f123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000) of type\u202fEiffelTestSuiteStartedEvent, version\u202f1.1.0, was recorded at Unix time\u202f1720123456. It carries the tags\u202fci\u202fand\u202feiffel. The source of the event is Jenkins running on host\u202fci.example.com\u202fwithin the domain\u202fexample.com; the job can be accessed at\u202fhttps://ci.example.com/job/123. The source serializer is identified by\u202fgroupId\u202fcom.example,\u202fartifactId\u202feiffel-serializer, version\u202f2.0.1. Security metadata indicates the author identity\u202fjohn.doe@example.com\u202fwith encrypted digest\u202fa1b2c3d4e5f6.\n\nThe test suite named\u202fSmokeTestSuite belongs to the categories\u202fregression\u202fand\u202fsmoke, and is classified as\u202fFUNCTIONAL\u202fand\u202fSTABILITY. Live logs are available, for example the\u202fstdout\u202flog at\u202fhttps://ci.example.com/job/123/log. Custom data attached to the suite includes\u202fenvironment\u202f=\u202fstaging\u202fand\u202frunId\u202f=\u202f42. The event links back to its cause with target\u202f9b2e1c3d-4f6a-3a9b-8c2d-3e4f5a6b7c8d\u202fand provides context via target\u202fabcd1234-ef56-2a90-9abc-ef1234567890.",
